<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord has regenerated me,</l><l>Calling me out of Satan’s kingdom into Him;</l><l>Day by day, He is renewing me,</l><l>Sanctifying, transforming me to be like Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, help me to live a God-man life</l><l>At home, with the saints, or wherever I would be;</l><l>Taking Christ, living Christ as my life</l><l>Exercising forbearance without anxiety.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I want to be an overcomer</l><l>O Lord, I consecrate myself to You right now.</l><l>O Lord, make me an overcomer—</l><l>Today and for the rest of my days here on earth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
